/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Acceptance Angle \(theta_a\): The maximum half-angle of the external acceptance cone) Tj
T*
(at the fiber launch face within which launched rays undergo TIR down the core:) Tj
T*
(Applying Snell's law at air-core entry interface: n_0 * sin\(theta_a\) = n1 * sin\(90 -) Tj
T*
(theta_c\) = n1 * cos\(theta_c\) = n1 * sqrt\(1 - sin^2\(theta_c\)\) = n1 * sqrt\(1 - \(n2/n1\)^2\)) Tj
T*
(= sqrt\(n1^2 - n2^2\).) Tj
T*
(Assuming launch in air \(n_0 = 1.0\): sin\(theta_a\) = sqrt\( n1^2 - n2^2 \). Acceptance) Tj
T*
(angle: theta_a = asin\( sqrt\( n1^2 - n2^2 \) \).) Tj
T*
(* Numerical Aperture \(NA\): A dimensionless figure of merit quantifying the) Tj
T*
(light-gathering capacity of the fiber:) Tj
T*
(Formula: NA = sin\(theta_a\) = sqrt\( n1^2 - n2^2 \).) Tj
T*
(* Fractional Refractive Index Contrast \(Delta\): Relative refractive index difference:) Tj
T*
(Delta = \(n1 - n2\) / n1 ~= \(n1^2 - n2^2\) / \(2 * n1^2\).) Tj
T*
(Approximation for weakly guiding fibers \(Delta << 1\): NA = n1 * sqrt\( 2 * Delta \).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
